1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,520
Sabe onde

2
00:00:00,520 --> 00:00:02,800
a Moranguete tá agora, Bananildo?

3
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:06,480
Você aqui todo santo dia...

4
00:00:06,480 --> 00:00:08,440
Ela cuida das crianças.

5
00:00:08,440 --> 00:00:09,260
E cuida do corpo

6
00:00:09,260 --> 00:00:09,820
pra mim,

7
00:00:09,820 --> 00:00:10,820
lá na academia.

8
00:00:10,820 --> 00:00:11,980
Na academia,

9
00:00:11,980 --> 00:00:13,166
é? Sei...

10
00:00:13,166 --> 00:00:14,226
Mais uma,

11
00:00:14,226 --> 00:00:15,926
princesa... só mais uma.

12
00:00:15,926 --> 00:00:16,946
E o maridão?

13
00:00:16,946 --> 00:00:17,986
Fazendo hora extra.

14
00:00:17,986 --> 00:00:19,806
Pelos filhos dele.

15
00:00:20,486 --> 00:00:21,636
Dele...

16
00:00:21,636 --> 00:00:23,596
Esse carteiro nunca atrasa, hein?

17
00:00:23,596 --> 00:00:24,656
Todo santo dia.

18
00:00:25,036 --> 00:00:26,896
Todo santo dia, amor.

19
00:00:27,228 --> 00:00:29,448
Puxaram tudo do papai.

20
00:00:29,448 --> 00:00:31,608
Família... eu preciso dizer

21
00:00:31,608 --> 00:00:32,048
uma coisa.

22
00:00:32,048 --> 00:00:34,288
Eu não sei

23
00:00:34,288 --> 00:00:34,748
o que eu seria

24
00:00:34,748 --> 00:00:35,728
sem a minha esposa...

25
00:00:35,728 --> 00:00:37,761
e os meus lindos filhos.

26
00:00:37,761 --> 00:00:40,121
Imagina, amor... eu?
